menu "Pocket experimental audio"
config BSP_AUDIO_CALLBACK_RENDER
    bool "Experimental callback-owned DMA render accounting"
    default n
    select I2S_ISR_IRAM_SAFE
    help
        Source-tested only. Enables bounded digital-render queue and descriptor
        accounting APIs; does not activate streaming, prove acoustics, or align
        microphone capture timing. Requires explicit application integration and
        hardware acceptance. Legacy default remains off.
endmenu
